<title>DUBAI: Dubai Investments to spend $41 mln on Marmum Dairy.</title>
<headline>Dubai Investments to spend $41 mln on Marmum Dairy.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Arab Emirates holding company Dubai Investments said it has taken over the Marmum Dairy Farm and plans to spend 150 million dirhams ($41 million) upgrading and expanding the farm in the next five years.</p>
<p>Dubai Investments, a public joint stock company, said the dairy farm -- the third largest in the UAE -- would invest in new equipment and technology and widen its product range.</p>
<p>($1=3.67 dirhams)</p>
